# U6-Marketing Department Guidelines

## Department Overview

### Core Responsibilities
- Lead communications and marketing initiatives
- Manage FischEYe production design
- Create and maintain brand identity
- Develop client-facing materials
- Coordinate social media presence
- Align all implementations with the Communicate (U6) philosophical principle

### Department Alignment
- Communicate (U6) philosophical principle
- Clear and effective communication
- Authentic brand representation
- Engaging storytelling
- Building genuine connections
- Transparent marketing practices

